DESCRIPTION:Meet at 10 AM for breakfast at The Loop. Dress festive and brin
 g a toy for kids in need. The brewery-to-brewery ride continues through th
 e afternoon. Brewery stops, the final brewery, and the toy collection loca
 tion will be announced closer to ride day. The calendar blocks time throug
 h 5:30 PM as an estimate; the actual finish time may vary.\n\nWebsite and
  ride updates: https://scrmsp.org\n\nFacebook RSVP (optional but appreciat
 ed): https://www.facebook.com/events/1972798296683555/\n\nThe ride is free
  and no registration is required. Ride at your own risk and follow traffic
  laws. If you’re drinking, arrange a sober driver.
